    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/5ed1aff29167bf33f68d2a49005341e6.poster.avif?t=1728750180\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/5ed1aff29167bf33f68d2a49005341e6.webm?t=1728750180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/5ed1aff29167bf33f68d2a49005341e6.mp4?t=1728750180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/0d5252bfd180680249798edefce36403.avif?t=1728750180\" width=600 height=86 /></span><br><br>In <strong>Dungeon Slime Hero</strong> You take up the role of a Slime whose friends have been captured by the Dungeon's bosses! Explore the dungeon, find loot, and free your friends to become the Dungeon Slime Hero!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomly Generated Dungeons, enemies and loot<br></li><li>Click to move, interact, and attack system<br></li><li>Equip Attacks System - Unlock new attacks for your Slime and equip them strategically in limited attack slots<br></li><li>Hidden and Puzzle Rooms - Find extra loot in hidden rooms! <br></li><li>Leveling - Level up to Increase your Stats<br></li><li>Loot - Find and absorb relics to increase your stats and give unique abilities<br></li><li>Rogue lite progression - Leveling up in the dungeon provides bonuses for the next run. Unlock new powerful Slimes for getting deeper in the dungeon!<br></li><li>4+ Unlockable Slimes<br></li><li>Unique special powerful attacks</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up! Clearing rooms will allow you to level and increase your stats.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/07e0f6799dc142cd098d14f8cbbace19.poster.avif?t=1728750180\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/07e0f6799dc142cd098d14f8cbbace19.webm?t=1728750180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/07e0f6799dc142cd098d14f8cbbace19.mp4?t=1728750180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeon Slime Hero features a click to move, interact, and attack system. With Controller Support!</strong></h2> You learn and equip powerful attacks in Attack Slots that your Slime uses to defeat foes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/01b5cbb24bc085e9bc60e43f9566e039.poster.avif?t=1728750180\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/01b5cbb24bc085e9bc60e43f9566e039.webm?t=1728750180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/01b5cbb24bc085e9bc60e43f9566e039.mp4?t=1728750180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free your fellow Slimes to become the Dungeon Slime Hero!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/7fe58e620c79536ed5d4fa2fa94a599f.poster.avif?t=1728750180\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/7fe58e620c79536ed5d4fa2fa94a599f.webm?t=1728750180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885630/extras/7fe58e620c79536ed5d4fa2fa94a599f.mp4?t=1728750180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
